# 二进制资产禁止换行转换。
# 否则在 core.autocrlf=true 的机器上 clone 出来，PDF / XLSX / SQLite 会被改写而损坏
# （2026-10-17 提交 PDF 时 git 就报过「LF will be replaced by CRLF」）。
*.pdf    binary
*.xlsx   binary
*.xls    binary
*.docx   binary
*.pptx   binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.bin    binary
*.parquet binary
